    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "v612ifk",
      "content": "Horticulture is the science and art of growing fruits, vegetables, ornamental plants, flowers, and spices. India is the second largest producer of fruits and vegetables in the world after China. The horticultural sector contributes about 30% of agriculture GDP from only 8.5% of total cultivated area."
    },
